  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "Acer platanoides 'Princeton Gold' Rare Golden Norway Maple Zones 4-8 Acer platanoides 'Princeton Gold' is a remarkable Norway maple cultivar prized for its vivid yellow foliage. Its bright, golden leaves emerge in spring and hold their color through the summer, creating a striking contrast against darker greenery in the landscape. This tree grows to a height of 15-20 ft with a spread of 12-15 ft, featuring an upright, rounded form. It exhibits a moderate to fast growth rate, making it a standout addition to any garden. These 7 & 10 gallon trees are for local pickup only, we cannot ship them because they are too big. The MrMaple Nursery is located in East Flat Rock, NC. Please contact us to arrange a pickup time."
